&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Be a key voice in shaping and delivering security strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary, equity, and benefits with meaningful work attached&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
